[{"client_msg_id":"76157206-012d-41c0-b099-de58b3372760","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"軽い語り口で書かれるチュートリアルって良くありますよね","ts":"1627223536.432400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"aruaru","count":2,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/5THx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fd74d9c-d6c4-4e5e-9626-7a473168d951","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"「するといいでしょう」とかたしかにある程度チュートリアル文章にありそうですしね","ts":"1627222618.431500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c8Iy0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"127624c7-bc2c-4dc5-a235-54069ae8a026","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"はい、おそらくそうだと思います。「〜したくなるでしょう」だと後ろの文とうまくつながらないので。\n「〜することをおすすめします」とか「〜したほうがよいでしょう」ぐらいの意味合いですかね。\nYou may want to は使ったことあるけど will はなかったなあ","ts":"1627222504.431000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uux"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbe1ff33-3b75-460e-8216-e1fdde797de7","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"今回の will want to は推奨の意味合いですか?","ts":"1627222278.429300","edited":{"user":"U017BU3UZBQ","ts":"1627222329.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qX7oD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b4116fb-f7ed-403a-9fed-39eca678a975","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"個人的には1文前の\n\u0026gt; After each step in this tutorial, you will want to recompile `kilo.c`, see if it finds any errors in your code, and then run `./kilo`.\nがちょっと勉強になった（will want to の用法を知らなかった）","ts":"1627222078.428900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+NP2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85465586-273a-4faf-88bf-f208ed094001","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"このような感じに訳してみました、あまり直訳にはなってないのですが\n````./kilo`の再コンパイルを忘れ実行だけして、なぜ`kilo.c`への変更が`./kilo`に反映されていないのか悩むことはありがちです。\n`kilo.c`の変更を`./kilo`に反映させるには再コンパイルしなければなりません。```","ts":"1627222073.428700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ro="}]},{"client_msg_id":"b25bbce9-6a73-4c6c-b821-e43182973947","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"動詞並列はよくあるから、まどわんようにしないとな....","ts":"1627222050.428000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MO9RS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbc89e88-0cc2-43f5-a38d-5d261e917c0e","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"本当に丁寧にありがとうございます:cat-dogeza-mike:\n次似たような文に会ったら意識して見てみます!","ts":"1627221904.426300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m+v/C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"564e4a51-f388-4c2d-b7c9-d885b4e2a294","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"itから始まる文、なかなか難度が高い(前を受けているのか、この文の後ろのそれなのか)","ts":"1627221815.425500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uxbJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf13388d-b2fb-4883-895a-c84c26b5480b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"実際、ここの it は to 不定詞以下を表しているので、そんなに間違ってはいないと思いますよ。（今回はその to 不定詞以下が3つあるはずなんですが）","ts":"1627221757.424600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+gVbG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4864cae7-8c87-42af-804a-764c14f03683","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"なるほど~\n初め to forget to recompile is easy と訳してしまってました….","ts":"1627221700.423800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kx21"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f33e0d35-579b-4093-bb52-f9724577fd34","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、たしかにそうですねえ、各文がそれぞれだったのでうまく拾えてなかった\nよくあるのはandの先が類似の文章形態っていうのが簡単なのでついw","ts":"1627221689.423700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3c=N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"896cfe98-16ef-483e-a88e-1fd664129fac","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"この文ぐらいきれいな英語だったら構文解析してしまうのが良いと思います。\nand は等位接続詞なんで、基本的に同じ種類のものを並列につなぎます。プログラミング言語でいうと全部同じ型の要素で構成されたリストみたいなもんです。\nなので、1文目を構文解析するとしたら、根本の構造はこうなるでしょう。\n\nIt is easy to\n• forget to recompile\n• just run `./kilo`\n• wonder \"why your changes to `kilo.c` don't seem to have any effect\".\nどの動詞が並列につながっているかの解釈によって意味が変わってくるので、このあたりは大事ですね。","ts":"1627221594.422200","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1627221623.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"spiral_note_pad","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"txj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c9037cd-6dc7-4dae-9d95-655b234ef477","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"just run ! just 実行*だけ*して !","ts":"1627221229.418300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2XDu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97b75617-5257-4569-af5f-4532be0ab147","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なるほどなるほど","ts":"1627221215.417800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yBTh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e34b1ee0-70ba-4a66-babb-60e9fad1b418","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"おぉなるほど:eyes:\nbe easy toが「しがち」の意味合いになっていることに気づけていませんでした。","ts":"1627221145.416400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/k2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d466539-675d-4482-a162-7011e5db1b03","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"えーとですね、たぶん forget と run と wonder が並列なんですよ。なぜなら、\"It\" が主語だとしたら \"It just run ...\" となって意味が通らないから。\nIt is easy to forget, and it is easy to just run, and it is easy to wonder. という構造なんだと思います。\nなので「forget して run だけして、 wonder しがち」って訳すのがいいかなと思います。","ts":"1627221104.416100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v0qj0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"288d099d-a19a-4673-a631-3f093e5fa43c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"seemが見え(ない)ってやるの、若干やりすぎな直訳だけど","ts":"1627221042.414900","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1627221053.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Skao"}]},{"client_msg_id":"585adc99-869e-407f-b6fe-08e3c8a3b948","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"やや雑","ts":"1627221012.414000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KYv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0c78dc6-eb9b-40f5-9c03-6e3b4869ad90","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"「よくあるリコンパイル忘れは、`./kilo` を実行しても、あなたがやったことが何も見えません。`kilo` に反映するなら  `./kilo.c` を変更した後はリコンパイルしなくちゃね」みたいなとこ?","ts":"1627220978.413100","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1627221097.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1/hGx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69b387b6-0b07-4507-8c32-5048a34abb14","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"つまり雑に訳すならこうです。\n\nリコンパイルするのを忘れて `./kilo` の実行だけを行ってしまうことで、「あれー `kilo.c` を変えた変更がなんの効果もないみたいだよー」ってなりがちです。\n`kilo.c` の変化を `kilo` に反映させるにはリコンパイルを行わないといけません。","ts":"1627220940.412300","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1627221235.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yCz+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e922fe6f-3234-4fe7-b4b7-be6a83657b72","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"再コンパイル忘れるのあるあるすぎる(関係ない)","ts":"1627220918.411600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YNx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e57f98db-46ba-486f-a0d6-b4437084bc86","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"recompile するのは忘れやすくって、ただ単に ./kilo ってやって、 kilo.c に変更したのに何も変わらないのはどうして？って悩むことになる。kilo.c の変更が kilo に反映されるようにするには、recompile しないといけない。","ts":"1627220890.410200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UwQY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16879c75-86fd-488b-9539-bba3e36ed185","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"be easy to の意味がポイントじゃないすかね。ここでは「〜しがち」という意味じゃないかと思います。","ts":"1627220827.407900","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1627220844.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u1T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b793f65e-42c2-476d-9d11-65e5d6f7c31e","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"悩んでもわからなかったので質問させてください！\nいま、\u003chttps://viewsourcecode.org/snaptoken/kilo/01.setup.html\u003e を翻訳しようとしているのですが、最後の文書が何を言っているのかさっぱりわかりません。\n自分の不勉強が原因なんですが、もしよろしければ解説していただけないでしょうか\n```It is easy to forget to recompile, and just run `./kilo`, and wonder why your changes to `kilo.c` don't seem to have any effect.\n You must recompile in order for changes in `kilo.c` to be reflected in `kilo`.```\n再コンパイルを忘れてしまい、変更からなんの効果も見えないと悩むとき\nあなたは簡単にkiloに変更を反映できる というように呼んで (? ?)となっています","ts":"1627220677.405800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=IrS"}]}]
